    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia kūsaata na kūnīlīīla SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Hezekia akasaata, ūsaaja ikanza iguhī ache. Ū ng'hangi Isaya, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amozi, ūja koi; aho washika ūng'wīla, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Īgolanyage chiza ī mihayo ya ha ng'wako, nguno ūkūcha; ūtūpīlaga.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūgalūkīla kū ndugu ūnomba ū SEEBA alīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee SEEBA, izūkagwa ūmo nalūshimīzīlaga kū būtongi wako, mu būshikanu na ng'holò ya kwifunya kwa ng'hana; nū mu miso gako nalīītaga yawiza.” Ū Hezekia ūlīla mu kūsaatwa kūtaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ū Isaya gūlīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jaga ūkang'wīle ū Hezekia, ‘Ū SEEBA ū Mulungu o ng'wa Daūdi nkūlūgenji wako alīyomba gīkī, Naakwigwaga ū kūlomba kwako, nī shisoji shako nashibonaga, nakūkongeja myaka ikūmi n'ītano a ha būlamu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo nakūkūpīja ū bebe nū nzengo gwenūyū kūfuma ū mu nkono gwa ntemi wa Ashulu, nakūgūlwīlīīla ū nzengo gwenūyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shimanīkījo sha kūfuma kūlī SEEBA kūlwa koolekeja gīkī ū SEEBA akūgwīta ū mhayo ūyo wakwisagījaga shiishi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbeho īyo yikaga malinhīlo ikūmi a ha ngaji ja ng'wa Ahazi kūlwa kūdeema kwa līīmi, nakwīyīta īshoke numa a ha malinhīlo ikūmi genayo.’” Na ng'hana ī līīmi lyūshoka kū numa, nī mbeho yūlinhūka a ha malinhīlo ikūmi genayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyīmbo lya ng'wa Hezekia, ntemi wa Yuda, īlo akandīka aho wapīla kūfuma mu būsaatu ūbo walī wasaata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
